'''Commitment Phobia''' is mob that spawns during the [[Great Spook|Great Spook]], after the death of a {{MobSprite|Primal Fear}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Commitment Phobia''' will walk slowly towards the player once spawned dealing {{Stat|dmg|1}}. They have {{Stat|hp|5}} and like [[Spooky Mobs]], take only {{Stat|Damage|1}} per hit. Once they only have {{Stat|hp|1}}, they start speaking in chat, alongside their dialogue a message that must be clicked will be sent. After clicking the message '''Commitment Phobia''' disappears, giving the player their drops.

